&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to transform how companies use data. Come be a part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;ClickHouse is the fastest analytical database in the world. Built for engineers and used by companies operating at massive scale.&amp;nbsp; Our users care about performance, clarity, and control. Our brand reflects that. We communicate directly, avoid marketing fluff, and focus on real technical capability.&amp;nbsp; Design plays a central role in how ClickHouse communicates with the world. From product launches to conference booths, every touchpoint should reflect the same clarity and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Creative Director &lt;/strong&gt;to help shape how the ClickHouse brand is expressed across marketing.&amp;nbsp; This role focuses on developing creative ideas, improving the overall quality of marketing work, and elevating how ClickHouse shows up across campaigns, launches, and events.&amp;nbsp; You will work closely with the Head of Design and marketing leadership, contributing creative thinking and helping bring ideas to life through collaboration with the design team.&lt;/p&gt;
