&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to transform how companies use data. Come be a part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;ClickHouse is on a mission to grow a vibrant global user community and accelerate our journey as a cloud first company. We&#39;re looking for a seasoned Digital Native Account Executive to help expand our footprint among Israel&#39;s digital native companies - AI-native startups, cloud-first scale-ups, and next-generation tech companies - and shape the future of ClickHouse adoption in the region. This is an exciting opportunity to join after the general availability of our serverless Cloud product and play a pivotal role in defining how it is positioned and adopted with this fast-moving segment of the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate brings both business acumen and technical depth, capable of guiding digital native customers with specialized expertise to help them achieve their objectives and unlock the full value of ClickHouse.&lt;/p&gt;
