&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Co-build and co-sell with cloud service providers and regional SIs: run discoveries, hands-on workshops, and POCs that create technical champions and accelerate partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and deliver repeatable enablement programs — slides, demos, solution briefs, and train-the-trainer sessions — that scale ClickHouse knowledge across partner organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Package reusable solution playbooks for key workloads including real-time analytics, logs and observability, product analytics, IoT, and AI features, with TCO and performance guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support CSP marketplace listings, co-sell mechanics, partner program requirements, and compliance artifacts in collaboration with Alliances and Ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Present at joint partner events and meetups across India and the broader APJ region; capture partner and customer feedback and funnel it back to Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work in a fast-moving environment where your technical output directly shapes how ClickHouse is adopted across one of the world&#39;s most important growth markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
