&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with one of the fastest-growing open-source projects and databases in the industry, at the center of the real-time analytics category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a technically excellent, customer-obsessed team that ships fast and takes ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, equity, and benefits, with a remote-friendly, distributed culture.&lt;/li&gt;
