&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to transform how companies use data. Come be a part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;ClickHouse is on a mission to grow a &lt;strong&gt;vibrant user community&lt;/strong&gt; and establish ourselves as a &lt;strong&gt;cloud-first company&lt;/strong&gt;. We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to help expand our presence in the region by empowering customers and users to unlock the full potential of ClickHouse.&amp;nbsp; This is an exciting opportunity to join after the &lt;strong&gt;general availability of our serverless Cloud product&lt;/strong&gt; and play a pivotal role in defining how it is positioned and adopted in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
