&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to transform how companies use data. Come be a part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are currently growing our support team at ClickHouse, which provides excellent service to our customers around the world. We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Technical Customer Support Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join our global Support Engineering team. We hope to find you ready to take on a variety of tasks related to our customers across EMEA, as well as more globally across the Americas, and APJ regions when support is needed or coverage overlaps. This is a customer-facing role that will include interactions via chat, calls, Slack messages, and video meetings. You will be owning a wide variety of tasks: from triaging support tickets to user community support, helping with both pre- and post-sales customer activities, partnering with our Go To Market team with deeply technical aspects of POCs, and suggesting improvements to how we do things in Support at ClickHouse. This is a great opportunity for someone ready to roll up their sleeves and help us continue to provide excellent customer support to our rapidly growing user base.&lt;/p&gt;
